<!-- Volume simple curves to be used by Volume-Helper to determine the volume
     to be applied to each stream based on the category of the device being used.

     Volume order is index:value.
     The length of the curve is implicitly the number of elements:
     volume: 0:-2500, 33:-1600, 66:-800, 100:0
     represents a curve with 4 elements, with linear interpolation between each
     range.

     The volume index is in the range [0, 100].
     The volume in dB is in the range [-9600, 0].
-->

